translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_d9faa267:

    # mom "A ti también, pero de otra forma. Y contigo también lo hablaré en su momento, y en privado."
    mom "You too, but in a different way. And I'll talk to you too in due course also, and in private."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:893
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_b6de5149:

    # mom "Y antes de que protestes, esta es una de esas cosas que se tienen que hablar en privado."
    mom "And before you protest, this is one of those things that needs to be talked about in private."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:895
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_e26fbe29:

    # emm "Tenéis razón... Entonces voy a ir bajando a la piscina. Os dejo solos."
    emm "You are right... Then I'm going to go down to the pool. I'll leave you two alone."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:897
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_25780dba:

    # "Cuando [emm] se ha ido..."
    "When [emm] is gone..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:898
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_79e0d6b9:

    # mc "Dime. Parece serio..."
    mc "Tell me. It looks serious..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:899
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c3709e18:

    # mom "Lo es. ¿Recuerdas cuando, durante la reunión con [aar], dijiste que habías hablado con tu padre?"
    mom "It is. Remember when, during the meeting with [aar], you said you talked to your father?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:900
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_d216a60c:

    # mom "Me había olvidado por completo, han pasado tantas cosas desde aquel día..."
    mom "I had completely forgotten about it, so much has happened since that day..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:902
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_07b00d0d:

    # mom "Hoy, cuando me he levantado, me ha venido como un flash."
    mom "Today, when I woke up, it came to me like a flash."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:903
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_8e8c81f2:

    # mom "Parece que hayan pasado un par de meses en vez de... ¿cuántos días han pasado?"
    mom "It seems like it's been a couple of months instead of... how many days has it been?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:904
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c451d65a:

    # mc "Cinco días. Fue el jueves."
    mc "Five days. It was on Thursday."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:906
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_3ee8d882:

    # mom "Vale. En cinco días no has tenido tiempo de explicármelo, ¿verdad?"
    mom "Okay. In five days, you haven't had time to tell me about it, how come?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:907
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_cfd530ab:

    # mc "[Mom!t], para mí también han pasado un montón de cosas. No hemos tenido un momento para hablarlo."
    mc "[Mom!t], a lot of things happened for me in those five days, too. We haven't had a moment to talk about it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:909
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_e742ee60:

    # mom "Tienes razón... Hablar de tu padre saca lo peor de mí."
    mom "You're right, I'm being unfair... Talking about your father brings out the worst in me."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:910
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_bd4e3e65:

    # mom "Explícame por qué y cómo estás en contacto con él."
    mom "Tell me why and how you are in contact with him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:911
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_971ed953:

    # mc "Lo primero es decirte que, aunque parezca raro, creo que lo que me ha contado es verdad."
    mc "The first thing is to tell you that, strange as it may seem, I believe that what he told me is true."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:913
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c55d8317:

    # mom "No sé qué te habrá contado, pero no entiendo cómo puedes creerte nada de lo que diga."
    mom "I don't know what he told you, but I don't understand how you can believe anything he says."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:914
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_ce178841:

    # mc "Porque no tendría sentido negar algo para admitir algo más... importante."
    mc "Because it wouldn't make sense to deny something only to later admit something more... important."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:915
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_9e5894d4:

    # mom "Sigue."
    mom "OK. Continue."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:916
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_7f143e4c:

    # mc "Papá está en Bali. Cuando se fue de aquí fue a Aruba y después se fue a Bali."
    mc "Dad is in Bali. He went to Aruba when he left, and then he moved to Bali."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:918
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5457ef21:

    # mom "Destinos tropicales donde estar con su amante y todo el dinero que nos robó a nosotros y a la universidad."
    mom "Tropical destinations to be with his mistress and all the money he stole from us and the university."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:919
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_9363335e:

    # mom "Bien, típico de él."
    mom "Fine, typical of him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:920
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:922
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_0335912f:

    # mom "¡Vale! Ya me callo."
    mom "Okay! I'll shut up now."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:923
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_7a11157b:

    # mc "La chica con la que se fugó no es su amante. Era una estudiante a la que estaba ayudando a instalarse en el hotel."
    mc "The girl he fled with is not his mistress. She was a student he was helping to get settled in the hotel."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:924
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_41bd3e1b:

    # mc "Ella le ayudó a instalarse en Aruba, ya que tenía amigos allí. Ahora está en Canadá de nuevo."
    mc "She helped him to get settled in Aruba, as she had friends there. Now she's in Canada again."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:926
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_e666e107:

    # mom "¿Y dices que le crees?"
    mom "And you say you believe him?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:927
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_b063e33a:

    # mc "Sí, [Mom!t]. Le creo. Después llegaré a eso. Pero eso no lo convierte en un santo."
    mc "Yes, [Mom!t]. I believe him. I'll get to that later. But that doesn't make him a saint."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:929
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_f1ab759f:

    # mom "¿Pero por qué se fue entonces? ¿Para ocultar sus delitos?"
    mom "But why did he leave then? To hide his theft from the university?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:930
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_e845de85:

    # mc "Es más complicado que eso. NTR nos vigilaba a todos. Eva y Amanda evitaban que se acercaran a vosotros, pero nadie evitaba que se acercaran a él."
    mc "It's more complicated than that. NTR was watching all of us. [eva] and [ama] kept them from approaching you guys, but no one kept them from approaching him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:930
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_9270d653:

    # mc "Es más complicado que eso. NTR nos vigilaba a todos. [eva] y [ama] evitaban que se acercaran a vosotros, pero nadie evitaba que se acercaran a él."
    mc "It's more complicated than that. NTR was watching all of us. [eva] and [ama] kept them from coming near you guys, but no one kept them from approaching him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:931
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_790c5a38:

    # mc "Y él los descubrió, pero no sabía quieres eran. En el fondo no era tan mal jefe de seguridad."
    mc "And he discovered them, but he didn't know who they were. Deep down he wasn't such a bad security chief."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:932
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_6cbc2468:

    # mc "Supongo que se cruzó con los que lo seguían a él y con los que os seguían a vosotras. Cuando se produjo el incendio en la universidad creía que habían querido matarlo."
    mc "I guess he crossed paths with those who were following him and those who were following you. When the fire broke out at the university he thought they had wanted to kill him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:934
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_6b6c6d80:

    # mom "¿Por qué iban a querer matarlo? Él no tiene nada que ver con NTR."
    mom "Why would they want to kill him? He has nothing to do with NTR."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:935
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c41a6026:

    # mc "No sabía que eran de NTR. Para él eran dos gemelos. Ahora sabemos que eran clones de la Serie G, y que había más de dos."
    mc "He didn't know they were from NTR. To him, they were two twin guys. Now we know they were G-Series clones, and that there were more than two."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:936
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_915c2f40:

    # mc "Pero él no tenía ni idea. Sabía que el incendio iba a descubrir sus robos a la universidad, con lo que cogió nuestro dinero y se fue."
    mc "But he had no idea. He knew the fire was going to uncover his thefts from the university, so he just took our money and fled."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:938
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_052a37b2:

    # mom "Bueno... no lo cogió todo..."
    mom "Well... he didn't take it all..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:939
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_350aef84:

    # mc "¿Cuánto dejó? Me dijiste que se había llevado vuestros ahorros."
    mc "How much did he leave? You told me he took your savings."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:940
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_679a5359:

    # mom "Dejó el fondo de la universidad de [emm]. Y dinero para un par de meses de gastos. Se llevó el resto."
    mom "He left [emm]'s college funds. And money for a couple of months of expenses. He took the rest."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:941
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_244237fe:

    # mc "Eso encaja más con su historia."
    mc "That fits more with his story."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:942
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_b9c8723c:

    # mc "Como te decía, se fue a Aruba a esconderse. Y sabes quién está en Aruba, ¿verdad?"
    mc "As I was telling you, he went to Aruba to hide. And you know who's in Aruba, right?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:944
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_7d994328:

    # mom "NTR. Se fue huyendo de ellos y no pudo elegir peor sitio."
    mom "NTR. He ran away from them and couldn't have picked a worse place."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:945
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_8cd01924:

    # mc "Exacto. A los pocos días se cruzó con otros Serie G. Creía que le habían seguido hasta allí y se fue a Bali."
    mc "Exactly. A few days later he crossed paths with other G-Series. He thought he had been followed there and left for Bali."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:946
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_76523aff:

    # mc "En Indonesia no hay extradición a Estados Unidos y creía que \"los gemelos\" no le seguirían hasta allí. Y, obviamente, no le han seguido."
    mc "There is no extradition to the United States in Indonesia, and he believed that \"the twins\" wouldn't follow him there. And, obviously, they didn't follow him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:949
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_a1c99d96:

    # mom "Si todo eso es así... quien le ha puesto los cuernos he sido yo, ¿no?... Me siento... sucia..."
    mom "If all that is the way you tell it... I'm the one who cheated on him, right? I feel... dirty..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:950
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_f9e0ac99:

    # mom "Lo hice pensando que su engaño me justificaba hasta cierto punto, pero ahora..."
    mom "I did it thinking that his cheating justified me to some extent, but now..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:951
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_9d9a305a:

    # mc "Ahora no cambia nada. Yo te quiero y tú me quieres. Cuando empezamos lo nuestro ninguno de los dos sabía nada."
    mc "Nothing changes now. I love you and you love me. When we started our thing neither of us had this information. And I won't stop what we started."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:952
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_f143e829:

    # mc "No quieras culpabilizarte por una decisión que tomaste con la información de la que disponías."
    mc "You don't need to blame yourself for a decision you made with the information you had available to you at the time."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:953
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_fc6b6702:

    # mc "Además, ya te he dicho que eso no lo convierte en un santo."
    mc "Besides, I already told you that this doesn't make him a saint."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:955
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_24daa50f:

    # mom "¿Se lo has dicho? ¿Que NTR no le persigue?"
    mom "Have you told him? That NTR is not chasing him?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:956
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_7ccb944a:

    # mc "No. Para cuando lo supe todo, después de la reunión con Aaron, ya no hablaba con él."
    mc "No. By the time I knew everything, after the meeting with Aaron, I was no longer talking to him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:958
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_bd3ccd89:

    # mom "¿Por qué? ¿Qué pasó?"
    mom "Why? What happened?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:959
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_fe8bda4b:

    # mc "Que demostró que, aunque aquella chica no fuera su amante, sigue siendo un cabrón."
    mc "That he proved that, even if that girl wasn't his mistress, he's still a scumbag."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:961
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_09c1fb80:

    # mom "¿Qué ha hecho esta vez?"
    mom "What did he do this time?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:963
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_06a584de:

    # mc "No te engañó hace dos meses."
    mc "He didn't cheat on you two months ago."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:964
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5166252b:

    # mc "Pero te engañó cuando estabas embarazada de [emm]."
    mc "But he cheated on you when you were pregnant with [emm]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:966
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_bd9cfefd:

    # mc "Engañó a mi madre, Anna, unos años antes del accidente."
    mc "He cheated on my bio mother, Anna, a few years before the accident."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:968
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_0154a3ae:

    # mom "¿Qué?"
    mom "What?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:969
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_141e836e:

    # mc "Tiene una hija de la edad de [emm]."
    mc "He has a daughter the age of [emm]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:971
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_54798bed:

    # mom "¿Qué? ¿Quién?"
    mom "What? Who?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:972
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_ca5342dc:

    # mc "No me lo quiso decir. Es por eso por lo que dejé de hablar con él."
    mc "He didn't want to tell me. That's why I stopped talking to him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:973
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_487a8a05:

    # mc "Le dije que cuando estuviera dispuesto a decírmelo volviera a llamarme. No lo ha vuelto a hacer."
    mc "I told him that he could call me back when he was ready to tell me. He hasn't called back."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:975
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_1816cd0e:

    # mom "Y por eso le crees cuando dice que no me engañó, ¿verdad?"
    mom "And that's why you believe him when he says he didn't cheat on me, right?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:976
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_ae29c00d:

    # mc "Sí, no tendría sentido negar que te engañó hace unos meses pero que tiene una hija por ahí."
    mc "Yeah, it wouldn't make sense to deny that he cheated on you a few months ago but has a daughter out there."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:978
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c03d81fb:

    # mc "Es engañarte igualmente. Sea ahora o hace 19 años."
    mc "It's cheating on you anyway. Whether it's now or 19 years ago."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:980
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_73908481:

    # mc "Es engañar a mi madre en vez de a ti."
    mc "It's cheating on my mother instead of you."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:981
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_a2c20d53:

    # mc "Sigue siendo un cabrón. Pero por alguna razón le creo en lo que pasó hace un par de meses."
    mc "He's still a scumbag. But, for some reason, I believe him about what happened a couple of months ago."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:983
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_709420e2:

    # mom "Lo entiendo. Tiene sentido que le creas. Pero a mí me es difícil creerle."
    mom "I understand. It makes sense that you believe him. But it's hard for me to trust him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:984
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5225c218:

    # mc "Me dijo que no sabía lo que le había pasado aquella noche. Que solo fue una vez. Aunque no sé si creerle en eso."
    mc "He told me he didn't know what happened to him that night. That it was just one time. I don't know if I believe him on that one, though."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:985
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_bdce7a37:

    # mc "No es que le vaya a perdonar por lo que hizo ni nada por el estilo, con lo que tampoco me importa demasiado."
    mc "It's not like I'm going to forgive him for what he did or anything, so I don't really care either."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:986
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5b04cd2d:

    # mc "Al menos en algo se comportó bien. El dinero que robaba de la universidad era para que a esa niña no le faltara de nada."
    mc "At least he behaved decently in one way. The money he stole from the university was so that girl wouldn't lack for anything."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:988
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_07dbde1e:

    # mom "¿Tenía que robar para eso?"
    mom "Did he need to steal for that?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:989
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_4c98abcc:

    # mc "Era la forma de que a nosotros tampoco nos faltase de nada."
    mc "It was the way to make sure we didn't lack anything either."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:990
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_9de67c43:

    # mc "No tenía lógica quitárnoslo a nosotros para dárselo a ella, con lo que se lo robó a la universidad."
    mc "There was no logic in taking the money from us to give it to her, so he stole it from the university."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:992
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_f1cce37e:

    # mom "Al final resultará que sí que le importábamos. Aunque me da lo mismo..."
    mom "In the end, it will turn out that he did care about us. Although I don't care..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:993
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_760dcc6b:

    # mom "Nos hizo mucho daño a [emm] y a mí. A ti también, pero no estabas aquí..."
    mom "It hurt [emm] and me a lot. You too, but you weren't here..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:994
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_7468cbaa:

    # mc "Eso parece. Por eso no se llevó el dinero del fondo universitario de [emm]."
    mc "It looks like it. That's why he didn't take the money from [emm]'s university fund."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:995
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_0e315aa8:

    # mc "Pero aún hay más."
    mc "But there's more."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:997
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_fb21bd9f:

    # mom "¿Más? No sé si quiero oír qué más ha hecho."
    mom "More? I don't know if I want to hear what else he's done."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:998
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_8498e4e9:

    # mc "No, [Mom!t]. En este caso lo he hecho yo."
    mc "No, [Mom!t]. In this case it's me who did it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:999
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_865db034:

    # mc "Es posible que haya encontrado a mi medio-hermana."
    mc "It is possible that I have found my half-sister."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1001
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_2ea70b64:

    # mom "¿Quién? No me digas que es una de las estudiantes..."
    mom "Who is she? Don't tell me she's one of the students..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1002
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5cb7df21:

    # mc "No. O no del todo. Hoy llegan los test de ADN."
    mc "No. Or not exactly. DNA tests are coming in today."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1003
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_a397fbdf:

    # mc "Creo... ella y yo creemos... que puede ser [sca]."
    mc "I think... she and I think... it may be [sca]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1005
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_5e359a6b:

    # mom "¿Qué? ¡No puede ser!"
    mom "What? It can't be!"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1006
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_4132f578:

    # mc "Las fechas cuadran. Ella no conoce a su verdadero padre, y sabemos que su padre le mandaba dinero a su madre."
    mc "The dates fit. She doesn't know her real father, and we know her father was sending money to her mother."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1007
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_ef064222:

    # mc "También sabemos que ha dejado de mandárselo poco después de que Papá se fugara. Es demasiada casualidad."
    mc "We also know he stopped sending it shortly after Dad ran away. That's too much of a coincidence."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1008
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_64b1b8a8:

    # mc "Sólo te pido que no digas nada, ni siquiera a [sca], hasta que lo confirmemos."
    mc "I'm just asking you not to say anything, not even to [sca], until we confirm it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1010
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_c0b2e576:

    # mom "Lo entiendo. No te preocupes."
    mom "I understand. Don't worry."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1011
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_86b1e9a3:

    # mc "Acordamos que no se lo diríamos a nadie hasta tener los resultados de ADN. Llegarán esta tarde."
    mc "We agreed that we wouldn't tell anyone until we got the DNA results. They will arrive this afternoon."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:1013
translate english c22s002_MarAboutEdmund_50410de9:

    # mom "Si es ella, ¿se lo diréis a la familia?"
    mom "If it's her, will you tell the family?"

