# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2516
translate english c22s004_diapers_02e6a676:

    # eri "Es que todas queremos que nuestros hijos crezcan juntos. Sería bonito..."
    eri "It's just that we all want our children to grow up together. It would be nice..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2517
translate english c22s004_diapers_c082266c:

    # mc "Sí que lo sería. Tienes razón. Un follón de pañales, pero bonito. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes, it would, you're right. A diaper mess, but nice. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2520
translate english c22s004_diapers_0cf9a6c7:

    # eri "Me estoy poniendo muy pesada con el embarazo, ¿verdad?"
    eri "I'm getting really annoying with the pregnancy, aren't I?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2521
translate english c22s004_diapers_c49e3fbc:

    # mc "No, cielo. Es raro, pero no te pones pesada."
    mc "No, honey. It's weird, but you aren't annoying."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2523
translate english c22s004_diapers_5ea32a04:

    # eri "Es que tengo muchas ganas de que llegue Hope. Sería tan bonito..."
    eri "I'm really looking forward to Hope's arrival. It will be so nice..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2524
translate english c22s004_diapers_2c8c6a70:

    # mc "Sí que lo sería. Tienes razón. Cambiar los pañales no tanto, por eso. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes, it will, you're right. Changing diapers not so much, though. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2525
translate english c22s004_diapers_edc8f8a6:

    # mc "Habrá que darle trabajo a Meemaw con lo de los pañales. *Risa*"
    mc "We'll need to give Meemaw some work to do with the diapers. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2528
translate english c22s004_group_2631728a:

    # "Después de la fiesta de la piscina, la cocina parece casi vacía sin [meg], [mad.nick], [sam], [sim], [oma], [sai], [kim], [kia], [eil], ni [kat]."
    "After the pool party, the kitchen looks almost empty without [meg], [mad.nick], [sam], [sim], [oma], [sai], [kim], [kia], or [eil]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2529
translate english c22s004_group_4f0edc75:

    # "Ni [jam]. Él está en el grupo, pero tú estás con las chicas."
    "Or [jam]. He's in the group, but you're with the girls."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2530
translate english c22s004_group_1e84bb41:

    # "Al final de la comida, [sca] ha creado un nuevo grupo en el que estás incluido. Por el número de notificaciones, es mucho menos activo que el grupo original."
    "At the end of the lunch, [sca] has created a new group in which you are included. By the number of notifications, it is much less active than the original group."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2531
translate english c22s004_group_3131a9bd:

    # "[bet] y [mee] se evitan durante toda la comida, como si estuvieran incómodas la una al lado de la otra."
    "[bet] and [mee] avoid each other throughout the meal, as if they were uncomfortable next to the other."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2538
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_a495802a:

    # "Poco después de comer, todos vais a cambiaros para pasar un rato en la piscina."
    "Shortly after lunch, you're all going to change into your swimsuits, to spend some time in the pool."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2539
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_2492d055:

    # "Mientras esperas que las chicas acaben de ponerse sus bikinis, llega un mensajero con los test de ADN."
    "While you're waiting for the girls to finish putting on their bikinis, a courier arrives with the DNA tests."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2541
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_bfd32212:

    # "Vas casi corriendo a la habitación que comparten [dap] y [sca], intentando llegar antes de que bajen a la piscina."
    "You go, almost running, to the room [dap] and [sca] share, trying to get there before they go down to the pool."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2542
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2543
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_8666b80b:

    # mc "Soy yo. ¿Puedo pasar?"
    mc "It's me. May I come in?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2544
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_9e27ff03:

    # dap "*A través de la puerta* Sí, pasa. Nos estábamos acabando de cambiar."
    dap "*Through the door* Yes, come in. We were just finishing changing."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2546
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_e7f6142c:

    # mc "¡Ha llegado la prueba de ADN!"
    mc "A courier just brought the DNA test!"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2548
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_ab17e58d:

    # sca "¡Ábrela! ¡Siento como si fuese el regalo de Navidad!"
    sca "Open it! I feel like it's a Christmas present!"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2549
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_2a4898f7:

    # dap "Esperad. ¿Queréis que me vaya? Puedo esperaros en la piscina."
    dap "Wait. Do you want me to leave? I can wait for you at the pool."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2550
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_1ba73269:

    # mc "Por mí no hace falta, ¿[sca]?"
    mc "No, I’m ok with you staying. [sca]?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2552
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_36506268:

    # sca "No, quiero que estés aquí. Eres la hermana que nunca tuve y ahora..."
    sca "No, I want you to be here. You're the sister I never had and now..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2554
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_0f93a04f:

    # mc "Ahora es posible que [emm] sea la hermana que siempre tuviste y nunca supiste."
    mc "Now it's possible that [emm] is the sister you always had and never knew about."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2556
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_9f9bfb51:

    # mc "Ahora es posible que yo sea el hermano que siempre tuviste y nunca supiste."
    mc "Now it's possible that I'm the brother you always had and never knew about."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2557
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_73b16163:

    # sca "Lo que acaba de decir [mc]. Pero tú siempre serás mi hermana, [dap]. Quiero que estés con nosotros cuando lo abramos."
    sca "What [mc] said. But you will always be my sister, [dap]. I want you to be with us when we open it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2558
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_c7773dc8:

    # dap "Gracias a los dos. Por confiar en mí y por querer que esté con vosotros en este momento."
    dap "Thank you both. For trusting me and for wanting me to be with you at this very important moment."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2559
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_f3fd243e:

    # mc "En este momento y siempre, [dap.nick]."
    mc "Now and always, [dap.nick]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2561
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_0345a487:

    # sca "Ábrela ya, por favor. La impaciencia me está matando."
    sca "Open it now, please. The anxiety is killing me."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2562
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_0d45b307:

    # mc "Voy, no me metáis prisa. *Risa nerviosa*"
    mc "Just a moment, don't rush me. *Nervous laughter*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2565
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_22b43b67:

    # mc "0%% de compatibilidad."
    mc "0%% compatibility."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2567
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_285a57ea:

    # mc "Lo siento, [sca]. No somos hermanos."
    mc "I'm sorry, [sca]. We're not siblings."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2568
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_57702b7b:

    # sca "Bueno..."
    sca "Well..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2570
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_fe94b7e1:

    # sca "Me siento menos decepcionada de lo que hubiera esperado."
    sca "I feel less disappointed than I would have expected."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2571
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_c29b1de9:

    # sca "Tenías razón, estaba poniendo mis esperanzas en pruebas circunstanciales tan solo. Había muchas coincidencias, pero eran solo eso. Coincidencias."
    sca "You were right, I was pinning my hopes on circumstantial evidence alone. There were a lot of coincidences, but they were just that. Coincidences."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2572
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_2304f2c3:

    # mc "Ven aquí, cielo."
    mc "Come here, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2574
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_554fd449:

    # sca "Por un lado tengo ganas de llorar, por otro, tengo ganas de reírme de mí misma."
    sca "On the one hand I feel like crying, on the other hand, I feel like laughing at myself."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2575
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_ebc9c4c4:

    # mc "Sabes que no vamos a dejar de buscar a tu padre, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know we're not going to stop looking for your father, right?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2576
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_1f8ae512:

    # mc "Y también sabes que, aunque no sea por sangre, ya perteneces a esta familia."
    mc "And you also know that, even if not by blood, you already are a part of this family."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2578
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_b4f05b4a:

    # dap "Si por sangre fuera, ninguno perteneceríamos a esta familia, [sca]. Lo que importa es que nos vemos como una familia, no el ADN."
    dap "If it were by blood, none of us would belong to this family, [sca]. What matters is that we see ourselves as a family, not because of the DNA."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2579
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_812efafa:

    # mc "Ven aquí, [dap.nick]. No puedes saber lo mucho que te quiero ahora mismo."
    mc "Come here, [dap.nick]. You can't know how much I love you right now."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2581
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_113b1ec2:

    # sca "Gracias. Sois maravillosos todos. No podría pertenecer a una familia mejor."
    sca "Thank you. You are all wonderful. I couldn't belong to a better family."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2582
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_cc150b60:

    # "El abrazo dura unos largos minutos en los que os prometéis que no dejaréis de buscar al padre de [sca] ni a tu medio hermana."
    "The hug lasts for a few long minutes during which you promise each other that you will not stop looking for [sca]'s father or your half-sister."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2584
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_50f3bee0:

    # sca "Deberíamos ir bajando a la piscina. Se van a preguntar dónde estamos y no quiero tener que dar explicaciones."
    sca "We should go down to the pool. They're going to wonder where we are and I don't want to have to do any explaining."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2585
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_af514b60:

    # mc "Yo pensaba ir un rato. Tengo que hacer unas cosas después."
    mc "I was thinking of going to the pool for a while. I have some things to do later."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2588
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_31c8e57b:

    # "[sca] explota en una carcajada que os deja anonadados a [dap] y a ti."
    "[sca] explodes in a burst of laughter that leaves you and [dap] stunned."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2589
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_52054a89:

    # sca "*Risa*"
    sca "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2590
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_3ef44222:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa, [sca]? ¿Qué has pensado que sea tan gracioso?"
    mc "What's the matter, [sca]? What did you think that was so funny?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2592
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_2a8c1534:

    # sca "*Risa* Que al menos nuestros hijos no serán endogámicos."
    sca "*Laugh* That at least our children won't be inbred."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2594
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_6e2b5e6e:

    # sca "Si los tenemos, claro"
    sca "If we have them, of course."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2595
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_0594dbf9:

    # mc "*Risa* No hay mal que por bien no venga."
    mc "*Laugh* Every cloud has a silver lining."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2596
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_f753e90a:

    # mc "*Risa* Además, te libras de tener una mierda de padre."
    mc "*Laugh* Besides, you avoid having a shitty father."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2597
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_94e0360a:

    # dap "Me alegra que no lleve mis genes. *Risa* Tío Edmund queda expulsado de la familia."
    dap "I'm glad I don't carry his genes. *Laugh* Uncle Edmund just got officially kicked out of the family."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2600
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_5c98cf6d:

    # mc "99.7%% de compatibilidad. ¿Por qué no es un 100%%?"
    mc "99.7%% compatibility. Why isn't it 100%%?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2602
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_207f0e30:

    # sca "{b}¿De verdad?{/b} ¿Somos hermanos?"
    sca "{b}Really?{/b} Are we siblings?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2603
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_efc06c7f:

    # mc "Bueno, medio-herm..."
    mc "Well, half-sib..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2605
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_f80a7fbe:

    # sca "¡Sí! ¡Sí! ¡Sí!"
    sca "Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2608
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_abd52fa4:

    # "Tu nueva medio-hermana te besa de forma apasionada. Hay mucho alivio en ese beso."
    "Your new half-sister kisses you passionately. There's a lot of relief in that kiss."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2610
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_fa015a3a:

    # "Tu nueva medio-hermana te abraza con fuerza. Hay mucho alivio en ese abrazo."
    "Your new half-sister hugs you tightly. There's a lot of relief in that hug."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2611
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_0b6ff569:

    # "Alivio por haber encontrado a una familia, aunque ya formara parte de ella."
    "Relief at having found a family, even though she was already part of it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2612
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_e8c693b7:

    # "Alivio porque por fin sabe quién es su padre."
    "Relief because she finally knows who her father is."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2613
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_7fbb5625:

    # "Alivio por no tener que seguir buscando."
    "Relief at not having to keep looking for him."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2615
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_e49fc5ca:

    # dap "Felicidades, chicos."
    dap "Congratulations, guys."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2616
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_348cb3a1:

    # mc "Gracias, [dap]."
    mc "Thank you, [dap]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2618
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_b8792cdd:

    # sca "¿No me vas a felicitar por pertenecer a la familia?"
    sca "Aren't you going to congratulate me for belonging to the family?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2619
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_b17bedfa:

    # mc "¿Por pertenecer a esta familia de bichos raros? *Risa* ¿Felicitaciones o condolencias?"
    mc "For belonging to this family of weirdos? *Laugh* Congratulations or condolences?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2621
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_24b8494c:

    # dap "No, no lo voy a hacer."
    dap "No, I'm not going to do it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2622
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_6fb843a1:

    # dap "Para mí, ya eras mi hermana. Ya pertenecías a la familia."
    dap "To me, you were already my sister. You already belonged to the family."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2624
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_c5c2b4d4:

    # dap "¿Ahora qué eres? ¿Una medio-prima?"
    dap "What are you now? A half-cousin?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2625
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_c2c11a9b:

    # dap "*Risa* Eso es casi como una desconocida."
    dap "*Laugh* That's almost like a stranger."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2626
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_4a7e6e26:

    # mc "*Risa* Ven aquí, [dap.nick]."
    mc "*Laugh* Come here, [dap.nick]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2628
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_a24ca89e:

    # sca "Aunque tienes razón, [dap], es un alivio haber descubierto quién es mi padre después de tantos años."
    sca "Although you are right, [dap], it's a relief to have discovered who my father is after so many years."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2629
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_d31d3d82:

    # mc "Aunque sea una mierda de padre. *Risa*"
    mc "Even if he's a shitty father. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2630
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_553322e8:

    # sca "*Risa* Exacto, aunque sea una mierda de padre."
    sca "*Laugh* Exactly, even if he is a shitty father."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2631
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_d1d0208a:

    # mc "Te entiendo. Yo solo hace una semana que sé que tengo una medio-hermana y no me quiero imaginar qué hubiera pasado si hubiera salido negativo."
    mc "I hear you. I've only known I had a half-sister for a week, and I don't want to imagine what would have happened if that came out negative."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2632
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_9139496e:

    # dap "Habláis demasiado en vez de disfrutar del abrazo."
    dap "You talk too much instead of enjoying the hug."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2634
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_78da8826:

    # sca "Habrá que decírselo a la familia, ¿no?"
    sca "We'll have to tell the family, won't we?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2635
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_494a6419:

    # mc "Sí."
    mc "Yes."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2636
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_a7af273e:

    # sca "No sé ni por dónde empezar. Creo que [mar] es la primera a quién se lo tendríamos que decir."
    sca "I don't even know where to start. I think [mar] is the first one we should tell."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2637
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_1bf788a5:

    # mc "Yo le he adelantado algo. Hace unos días se me escapó que había hablado con mi... con nuestro padre, y hoy me ha tirado de la lengua."
    mc "I've given her a little advance notice. A few days ago, it slipped out that I had talked to my... to our father, and today she interrogated me about it."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2638
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_04d86e89:

    # mc "No podía explicarle verdades a medias."
    mc "I couldn't lie to her."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2639
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_919c704a:

    # dap "No me hubiera gustado estar en tu situación cuando has tenido que explicárselo."
    dap "I wouldn't have wanted to be in your shoes when you explained it to her."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2641
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_babaf7a0:

    # sca "No importa. Era quien más miedo me daba, por el daño que le podía hacer."
    sca "It doesn't matter. She was the one I was most afraid of, because of the pain it could cause her."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2643
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_bab8b048:

    # dap "Vamos a ir la piscina. Se me ha ocurrido una cosa."
    dap "Let's go to the pool. I just thought of something."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2644
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_13854cce:

    # dap "Os espero allí. Dadme cinco de minutos para organizarlo todo. Necesito que alguien concreto esté allí."
    dap "I'll wait for you there. But give me five minutes to organize everything. I need someone specific to be there."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2645
translate english c22s004_ScarlettDNA_e8fe7918:

    # dap "Tú también ven, [mc]. La puedes seguir abrazando esos cinco minutos, si quieres."
    dap "You come also, [mc]. You can keep hugging her for those five minutes in the meantime, if you want."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2650
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_2560e44f:

    # "El abrazo dura cinco minutos que se hacen muy cortos. No necesitáis decir nada más de lo que vuestros brazos rodeando al otro dicen."
    "The five-minute hug feels too short. You don't need to say anything more than what your arms around each other say."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2652
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_bd25726a:

    # sca "No es que no se esté a gusto aquí, pero ¿vamos a la piscina? [dap.nick] se va a empezar a impacientar."
    sca "Not that it's not amazing being in your arms but, shall we go to the pool? [dap.nick] is going to grow impatient."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2653
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_bc8df2f6:

    # mc "Vamos. Tengo curiosidad por ver qué se le ha ocurrido."
    mc "Let's go. I'm curious to see what she came up with."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2656
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_7baa2ae0:

    # sca "Te quiero, hermanito."
    sca "I love you, brother."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2657
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_c02b3e4f:

    # mc "Te quiero, hermanita."
    mc "I love you, little sister."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2660
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_4ca99130:

    # sca "Te quiero, [mc]."
