# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:671
translate english c22s001_NoNorSex_64aa629b:

    # "Vas a tu habitación a jugar un rato a My Residence. La Tía alienígena del MC, Nellie, le tiene preparada una sorpresa cuando él la visita en su habitación."
    "You go to your room to play My Residence for a while. The MC's alien aunt, Nellie, has a surprise in store for him when he visits her in her room."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2745
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_7df829c9:

    # "Poco después de comer, mientras te estás poniendo el bañador para ir al jacuzzi, te llega un mensaje de [dap] diciéndote que te necesita en la piscina."
    "Shortly after lunch, while you're putting on your swim trunks to go to the hot tub, you get a text from [dap] telling you that she needs you at the pool."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2747
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_3fdf7a43:

    # "Cuando llegas a la piscina te encuentras con una escena un poco caótica."
    "When you arrive at the pool, you are met with a somewhat chaotic scene."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2825
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_4fb68c89:

    # "[sca] está tan perdida como tú, sin saber que se propone [dap]. Se ha quedado apartada sin saber qué pinta aquí..."
    "[sca] is as lost as you are, not knowing what [dap] is up to. She has been left alone without knowing what she is doing here..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2826
translate english c22s004_ScarlettReveal_14d5e535:

    # "Crees que nadie sabe qué se propone [dap]."
    "You don't think anyone knows what [dap] is up to."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2911
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_03e2ab71:

    # dap "Os habéis dado cuenta con los ejemplos de [eva] y [ama] de que no es necesario compartir genes para ser hermanas."
    dap "You have realized, from the examples of [eva] and [ama], that it is not necessary to share genes to be sisters."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2919
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_664969f4:

    # dap "Pero nadie duda de que sean hermanas. O de que [eva] sea mi hermana."
    dap "But no one doubts whether they are sisters. Or whether [eva] is my sister."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2925
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_29c985f9:

    # mee "Es tu hermana y es mi nieta perdida."
    mee "She's your sister and she's my long lost granddaughter."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2930
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_951671e8:

    # dap "Bien, Abuela. ¿O debería decir \"Sra. Que Se Hace Pasar Por La Abuela de [eva] y [ama]\"?"
    dap "Okay, Grandma. Or should I say \"Lady Impersonating [eva] and [ama]’s Grandma\"?"

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2935
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_ea73dd64:

    # mee "*Risa* Ni se te ocurra. Soy su abuela les guste o no."
    mee "*Laugh* Don't even think about it. I'm their grandmother whether they like it or not."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2956
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_36b275d9:

    # dap "Si [ama] y [eva] son de la familia porque elegimos que lo sean..."
    dap "If [ama] and [eva] are family because we choose them to be..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:2957
translate english c22s004_ScaUnPatch_dc19810b:

    # dap "Si la abuela es también su abuela porque así lo han decidido..."
    dap "If Grandma is also their grandmother because they have decided so... Although no one asked [eva] or [ama]..."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:3080
translate english c22s004_BookFerrarini_f4a3cb37:

    # "Subes a tu habitación después de despedirte de todo el mundo y darle un largo abrazo a [sca]."
    "You go up to your room after saying goodbye to everyone and giving [sca] a long hug."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:3081
translate english c22s004_BookFerrarini_3200efb7:

    # "Consigues mover la reserva del Ferrarini de [emm] al jueves a mediodía."
    "You're able to move [emm]'s Ferrarini booking to Thursday noon."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:3082
translate english c22s004_BookFerrarini_d4770799:

    # "Tendréis que pasar la noche en Monterey para devolverlo al día siguiente, con lo que reservas un hotel cerca del aeropuerto."
    "You will need to spend the night in Monterey to return it the next day, so you book a hotel near the airport."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:3083
translate english c22s004_BookFerrarini_5c0867fa:

    # "Una habitación sencilla para ti y una doble para [bet] y [emm]."
    "A single room for you and a double room for [bet] and [emm]."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:3085
translate english c22s004_BookFerrarini_636dd1f1:

    # "Cuando se lo dices a [emm] se emociona muchísimo y quiere empezar a preparar las maletas."
    "When you tell [emm], she gets really excited and wants to start packing her bags."

# game/scripts/c22/c22.rpy:4265
translate english c22s008_Sca_22614fe3:

    # "O al menos la prima en quien [dap] la ha convertido."
    "Or, at least, the cousin who [dap] has turned her into."

